# SDLC Process Location

- Process (state machine): `.claude/process/sdlc-reliability-loop/`
- Atomic skills: `.claude/skills/sdlc-*`
- Stage workers: `.claude/sdlc/<stage>/agents/`
- Quality scripts: `scripts/quality/`
- Loop state: `Sessions/loop/`; feature state: `Sessions/pipeline-<slug>/`

When orchestrating delivery or quality remediation, **read PROCESS.md and invoke the matching skill**. Do not paste a new six-stage procedure into the chat or skip `sdlc-gate-runner` evidence.
